WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.580
Hi guys, I'm in Japan right now

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.361
and I wanna share some differences between life in Korea and Japan.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.420
In South Korea,

00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:12.221
people are usually more quiet and don't really talk to a stranger.

00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:12.981
But in Japan,

00:00:12.982 --> 00:00:17.181
people feel a bit more social and I've seen more foreigners here

00:00:17.182 --> 00:00:19.701
in Korea, it's not super to common wear,

00:00:19.702 --> 00:00:22.421
you know, a colorful and bold outfit.

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:25.941
Honestly, I think Korea and is more easier than Japanese food,

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:28.901
especially desserts in Japan are so good,

00:00:28.902 --> 00:00:30.581
like next level. I feel.

00:00:30.582 --> 00:00:32.581
I've seen more kids here too.

00:00:32.582 --> 00:00:35.221
The streets in Japan are much wider

00:00:35.222 --> 00:00:39.981
and the city and building things kind of feel more like Europe or USA.

00:00:39.982 --> 00:00:42.901
But Korea and China feel more East Asia.

00:00:42.902 --> 00:00:46.001
Japan is definitely more expensive than Korea.

00:00:46.002 --> 00:00:50.421
I think China is cheapest than Korea and Japan is the most expensive.

00:00:50.422 --> 00:00:53.701
But in the end, if I had to choose a place to live,

00:00:53.702 --> 00:00:55.781
I pick Korea. But for traveling,

00:00:55.782 --> 00:00:58.805
definitely Japan. See you in the next video.
